# Advanced M1 Implementation Plan

You are absolutely right. The initial M1 implementation was a foundational skeleton. To handle complex industrial tasks, edge cases, and ensure enterprise-grade stability for the SIH hackathon, we need to significantly upgrade the M1 (Backend) components.

Here is the plan to upgrade M1 to an **Advanced Level**.

## User Review Required
