> Upgrading to an advanced architecture adds complexity. I will introduce asynchronous programming (`asyncio`, `httpx`), retry mechanisms (`tenacity`), and deep integration with the orchestrator.
> Please review the proposed changes below and confirm if this aligns with your vision for "advanced".

